PLUMLANG ITSELF
===============

The plum binaries the action installs are downloaded from
https://github.com/plumlang/plumlang/releases and are under the licence
shipped in each release archive (the Plumlang Commercial License 1.0). This
repository grants nothing over them.

EXCEPTION (names, marks, and royalties)
=======================================

The code and content grants above carry an explicit trademark and naming
exception:

	LICENSES/exceptions/Plumlang-trademarks

which also incorporates the Elixpo reservations in:

	LICENSES/exceptions/Oreo-trademarks

The licences grant rights to the files as files. They do NOT grant rights
to the Plumlang, Elixpo or Oreo names or brands, nor the right to publish a
fork of this action under them.

